        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "\nconst d = $json;\nreturn [{ json: { body: { reason: 'auto: coach read-only X search stopped: ' + d.reason, by: 'coach', dry_run: d.dry_run },\n  slack: { channel: 'C0000000001', text: `:warning: While reading X search (read-only) for the action list, the browser hit a warning / login / captcha-type page:\\n> ${d.reason.slice(0, 300)}\\nI paused automated engagement and the warm-up drops one step. Nothing was clicked, and I skipped this action list. the owner can say 'resume engagement' once it looks fine in the app.` } } }];\n"
